    "created_at": "2024-06-03T18:32:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-06-03T18:32:23Z",
    "body": "Right, the timing is not specified. But also, the spec doesn't try to prevent async scripts to run right after a sync script. If there's a web compat reason to do so, it would be good to specify something to that effect.",
